%% DPPL: interaksi teknis berdasarkan skenario SKPL
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Customer
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant Service as StatusQueryService
    participant Records as TransactionRepository
    participant Dep as LocationStream
    Customer->>UI: Select an order or service booking
    UI->>Service: Submit order and booking status request
    Service->>Records: Load the latest status and event timeline
    Records-->>Service: Return current records and validation result
    Service->>Service: Validate pemilik transaksi dan batas visibilitas lokasi
    alt Valid
        Service->>Dep: lastKnownLocation(booking)
        Dep-->>Service: Result
        Service->>Records: Prepare the current status view
        Records-->>Service: Confirm the saved or calculated result
        Service-->>UI: Display status and last known pickup location
        UI-->>Customer: Display the result and next step
    else Request needs correction or review
        Service-->>UI: Show the latest available status when updates stop
        UI-->>Customer: Display the reason and required action
    end
